cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Thiomarinol chemical genomics: figure code and data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and source data for Figures 2 and 3 of Johnson et al. 2021, a CRISPRi
  chemical-genomics screen of Bacillus subtilis essential genes identifying
  isoleucyl-tRNA synthetase as the target of the hybrid antibiotic thiomarinol.
authors:
